      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "@USBPChiefEPT made an arrest of an illegal alien attempting to cross the border into the United States. After agents made the arrest, it was uncovered that he had a prior conviction for forcible touching and sexual contact of a victim under the age of 13. \n\nThere is no way of knowing who comes across our borders without catching them and fully vetting them, but our agents hold the line to protect this country from intruders. This illegal alien will be charged with felony re-entry and deported back to his home country.",
      "text_resolved": "@USBPChiefEPT made an arrest of an illegal alien attempting to cross the border into the United States. After agents made the arrest, it was uncovered that he had a prior conviction for forcible touching and sexual contact of a victim under the age of 13. \n\nThere is no way of knowing who comes across our borders without catching them and fully vetting them, but our agents hold the line to protect this country from intruders. This illegal alien will be charged with felony re-entry and deported back to his home country.",
