      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "Another excellent seizure by West Palm Beach’s Trade Enforcement Team, with assistance from the Center of Excellence and Expertise Apparel, Footwear and Textiles team, West Palm CBP Research and Intelligence Operations Team (RIOT), and Homeland Security Investigations (HSI). \n\nThe operation resulted in the arrest of an individual on felony charges for possessing and intending to distribute over 25 counterfeit items. Additionally, two illegal aliens were identified by officers and transported to U.S. Border Patrol West Palm Beach Station for processing.\n\nThe estimated Manufacturer's Suggested Retail Price (MSRP) of the seized counterfeit merchandise, had it been genuine, exceeds $1,500,000.00 USD. Distribution of counterfeit products is not a victimless crime, CBP is committed to protecting the American public from dangerous and illicit goods.",
